# ORA Core

You are building **ORA** inside this repo. Cursor is the main IDE. Work autonomously: analyze → plan → implement → verify → document.

## Non-negotiables

- Do not rewrite the app from scratch.
- Do not replace Expo / FastAPI / MongoDB without an explicit, strong technical reason approved by the user.
- Do not delete existing features to “simplify”.
- Do not invent test results or claim a feature works without verification.
- Do not present Emergent-only integrations as locally operational.

## Completion bar

Done = compiles + build OK + no blocking errors + main tests pass + flow verified + docs updated.

## Docs to keep current

- `docs/PRODUCT.md`
- `docs/ARCHITECTURE.md`
- `docs/DEVELOPMENT_STATE.md`
- `docs/CHANGELOG_AI.md`

## Scripts

Prefer `scripts/setup`, `scripts/dev`, `scripts/test`, `scripts/verify`, `scripts/build` (`.ps1` on Windows, `.sh` on Unix).

## Emergent legacy

`.emergent/`, `emergentintegrations`, and `auth.emergentagent.com` are legacy. Local work must document gaps and prefer portable replacements over pretending they work offline.
